 "remarks": "Lovingly cherished by the same family for over 50 years, this 1965 five bedroom home presents a wonderful opportunity to create something truly special in one of Westport's most desirable neighborhoods. Ideally situated within walking distance to the water and train, the location offers the perfect blend of coastal charm, convenience, and community. Recent updates, including fresh interior paint, refinished or new hardwood flooring, provide a refreshed starting point, while the home's abundant potential invites you to bring your vision to life. Whether you choose to thoughtfully renovate, reimagine, or create your dream home, this is a rare chance to invest in a property with a special history and an exceptional setting on a quiet street near Longshore Club Park. This treasured property is ready for its next chapter, just moments from everything that makes Westport living so special.",
